# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/

# Supplier files we may not redistribute (`fetch-only` and `private`). Only
# their row in vendor-index.csv is committed. The file itself is fetched from
# the brand, or copied from stoq-private with `bash doqs.sh restore-private`.
# `bash doqs.sh check` fails if one of these files is tracked.
# Validation warns rather than fails when one is absent, so CI stays green on a
# fresh clone.
#
# List the exact paths your fetch-only rows name, for example:
#
# modules/thk/modules/shs-rail/cad/parts/SHS20R300.FCStd
# modules/thk/modules/shs-rail/cad/original/SHS20R300.step

# HIWIN: the terms do not allow sharing (2026-10-02). Our copies are in
# stoq-private at the same paths. The files stay in the history before that
# date; history is never rewritten.
modules/hiwin/docs/datasheets/hiwin-linear-guideways-GW-13-1-EN-2606-K.pdf
modules/hiwin/modules/hgl-block/cad/original/HGL15CA2R760ZBC2-ZZ+E2.step
modules/hiwin/modules/hgl-block/cad/original/HGL15CAZBC+E2.step
modules/hiwin/modules/hgl-block/cad/parts/HGL15CAZBC+E2.FCStd
modules/hiwin/modules/hgr-rail/cad/original/HGR15R418H.step
modules/hiwin/modules/hgr-rail/cad/parts/HGR15R418H.FCStd

# FreeCAD rotates a backup beside every document it saves. It is a copy of the
# file next to it, so it never belongs in the history.
*.FCBak
*.FCStd1
